[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-african-economic-scholars-program-aesp-2026-apply-now-100":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},100,"african-economic-scholars-program-aesp-2026-apply-now-100","African Economic Scholars Program (aesp) 2026 | Apply Now","\u003Cp>Are you a final-year student or recent graduate from Nigeria, Ghana, Kenya, or South Africa with a background in social.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested candidates for the African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: African Economic Scholars Program (AESP)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Africa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category:   \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Finternships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Ffellowships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Fellowships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Sponsorship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands on training on economic policy\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Networking\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Invaluable knowledge.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: African Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 19, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) is designed to equip young policy enthusiasts with practical, hands-on knowledge of policy design and implementation, while providing mentorship from seasoned economists and policy experts, as well as opportunities to connect with like-minded scholars across Africa.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) is a premier initiative designed for final-year students and recent graduates from Nigeria, Ghana, Kenya, and South Africa with backgrounds in Economics, Political Science, or related Social Sciences.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>It focuses on nurturing young talents through mentorship, hands-on policy research, and capacity-building workshops to shape Africa’s policy landscape, with upcoming applications for the 2026 cohort\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the African Economic Scholars Program (AESP), applicants must satisfy the following conditions\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must have studied or be studying:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Economics\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Political Science\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Or any related Social Science discipline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Final-year undergraduate students or Recent graduates\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You must be from one of the following countries:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ghana\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Kenya\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>South Africa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>graduated or be on track to graduate with a \u003Cstrong>First Class\u003C\u002Fstrong> or \u003Cstrong>Second Class Upper (2:1)\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must \u003Cstrong>not have graduated before 202\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>African Economic Scholars Program (AESP) Required Documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 African Economic Scholars Program (AESP), you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>School ID Card\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts from 100 level to final year\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>CV maximum of 2 pages\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for African Economic Scholars Program (AESP)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the African Economic Scholars Program (AESP), follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Prepare all necessary documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply via the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE:\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLScvlGpbhIq6ElMQamDXhP3Qri_9EXqzlqumHyK85ydtbwFuxQ\u002Fviewform?usp=dialog\">https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.google.com\u002Fforms\u002Fd\u002Fe\u002F1FAIpQLScvlGpbhIq6ElMQamDXhP3Qri_9EXqzlqumHyK85ydtbwFuxQ\u002Fviewform?usp=dialog\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-25 10:29:05",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fafrican-economic-scholars-program-aesp-2026-apply-now\u002F69c3aae16e64c4.38115893_screenshot 2026-03-25 102406.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flr